!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!  AGAR "Import openpyxl failed" / "mapping banayi nahi ja saki" AAYE
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

  Wajah: pandas bina openpyxl ke Excel (.xlsx) padh hi nahi sakta, aur
         us system ke Python me openpyxl laga hi nahi hai.
  Nuksan: KOI NAHI -- sync surakshit tarike se ruk jaata hai, dashboard
         purani mapping par chalta rehta hai, kuch mitta nahi.

  ILAAJ (ek hi baar):
     DASHBOARD\FIX_EXCEL_READER.bat   par double-click
  ya haath se:
     "<aapka python.exe>" -m pip install openpyxl

  Uske baad:  DASHBOARD\RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat
  (ya agli ghante wali Mapping Sync apne aap theek chal jaayegi)

!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

CHALANE KA TARIKA (kram zaroori hai):
  1. UPDATE_KARO.bat                   -> saari nayi file chali jaayengi
                                          (purani ka backup khud banta hai)
  2. DASHBOARD\FIX_EXCEL_READER.bat    -> Excel padhne wala purza (openpyxl)
                                          [sirf ek baar. pehle se ho to bhi
                                           chala sakte ho -- nuksan nahi]
  3. DASHBOARD\RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat  -> Mapping.xlsx -> handle_master ->
                                          Mongo -> dashboard. 4 step hain,
                                          beech me Y/N poochhegi.
  4. START_LIVE.bat ko BAND karke dobara chalao  -> server.js badla hai
     (startup par "BUILD: ..." line dikhegi -- wahi pehchan hai)
  5. Browser me Ctrl + F5

  DHYAN: step 2 aur 3 wali file APNE PROJECT ke DASHBOARD folder se
  chalani hai --  C:\...\DASHBOARD\RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat
  UPDATE_07-OCT\nayi-files\DASHBOARD\ waali copy se NAHI (wahan Mapping
  folder hota hi nahi). Galti se wahan se chalao to ab wo khud rok kar
  sahi raasta bata deti hai.

Galat ho jaaye to: WAPAS_KARO.bat  -> sab purana wapas.

