    sirf data\mapping_removed_candidates.json me dikhte hain.
  * MLA Contestants ka card 0 nahi raha (ab 267 mapping me).
  * Level card ka handle count ab MAPPING se -- Chief Ministers 31
    (pehle 30 dikhta tha, kyunki ek CM ka ek bhi tweet nahi aaya).
  * CM & Dy CM tab poori tarah mapping se: 50 leaders = 31 CM + 19 Dy CM.
    Jinke tweet nahi aaye unki row "No tweets yet" ke saath aati hai.

DASHBOARD
  * "Profiles" tab ka naam ab "Leader Board".
  * Admin Panel ka hak ab tick se milta hai (Active Logins -> Access ->
    "Admin panel"). Tick lagte hi us user ke profile menu me "Admin Panel"
