======================================================================
  MAIN SYSTEM PAR UPDATE  --  05 se 07 October
======================================================================

Poora folder copy karne ki zaroorat nahi. 17 files badalti hain + 3
saathi files jo sirf tab daali jaati hain jab wahan hain hi nahi.
Ye package wahi files aur ek script hai.


KYA KARNA HAI
=============

1. Ye poora folder "UPDATE_07-OCT" apne main system par
   "Main Twitter Project" folder ke ANDAR rakho:

       C:\Main Twitter Project\UPDATE_07-OCT\

2. Server band kar do (jo black window chal raha hai).
   Script khud bhi check karti hai -- chalta mila to ruk jaayegi.

3. UPDATE_KARO.bat  par double-click.

4. DASHBOARD\RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat  chalao.   <-- YE MAT BHOOLNA
   Ye Mapping.xlsx se handle_master.json banati hai. Sirf Excel
   badalne se kuch nahi hota -- dashboard handle_master.json padhta
   hai, Excel nahi.

5. START_LIVE.bat chalao.

6. Browser me Ctrl + F5 (dono dashboard par).

7. Sentiment pehli baar laga rahe ho to ek baar:
       DASHBOARD\INSTALL_SENTIMENT.bat

Kuch galat lage to WAPAS_KARO.bat -- sab purana ho jaayega.


======================================================================
  ISME KYA-KYA AAYA HAI
======================================================================


A. HANDLE TRACKER / SCRAPING
---------------------------

  * 24 ghante chunne par 2 October ka data aa jaata tha. Wajah: handle
    ka PINNED tweet saalon purana hota hai, aur us par scrape poora
    handle chhod deta tha. Ab purana tweet sirf chhoda jaata hai, rukta
    nahi. Tweet Database par date ka filter bhi lag gaya (pehle tha hi
    nahi).

  * Window ka dropdown apne aap "Pichhle 3 din" par wapas chala jaata
    tha (har 5 second wala refresh use dobara likh deta tha). Ab jis
    control ko aapne chhua hai use refresh haath nahi lagata.

  * "Ek handle ki kitni page" wala control hat gaya -- ab kitna
    peechhe jaana hai ye sirf date ki window se tay hota hai.

  * Live Scrape Log aur Tweet Database ab apne-apne alag tab me hain.
    Log ab upar se neeche padha jaata hai (pehle ulta tha), scraping ke
    waqt progress bar aata hai, khatm hone par "Done" likha aata hai,
    aur CSV download me poore 28 column aate hain (pehle 10 the).

  * Admin panel me Hindi nahi rahi -- sab English.

  * "operation exceeded time limit" wala error har 2 minute me dohra
    raha tha. Wo ginti ab bhaari aggregation nahi chalati, do naye
    index ban jaate hain, aur fail hone par 10 minute ka wait lagta hai
    (pehle har refresh par dobara chal jaati thi). Poora database scan
    ab maangne par: "Scan the whole database" button.


B. SENTIMENT
------------

  * Ab aapke apne trained sentiment_tagger se sentiment aata hai, aur
    poore 8 label aate hain:
      Pro BJP, Anti BJP, Pro Govt., Anti Govt.,
      Positive, Negative, Neutral, No Sentiments
    (Ye naam package se hi padhe gaye hain -- haath se nahi likhe.)

  * Trained model na mile to Sentiment ka khaana KHAALI chhoda jaata
    hai. Pehle 3-label wala fallback likh deta tha, jisse database me
    galat label chale jaate.

  * Poore page ke tweets ek hi call me tag hote hain (pehle har tweet
    par alag call).


C. MAPPING
----------

  * Jo handle mapping me nahi hai uska data ab seedha database me nahi
    jaata -- ruk jaata hai, aur admin panel mapping ke 11 column maangta
    hai. Do raaste: haath se form, ya CSV upload (jaanch ke saath).
    Mapping bharte hi uske purane row bhi theek ho jaate hain.

  * '-' ab theek maana jaata hai (official page me state/AC/PC nahi
    hota). Zaroori sirf do hain: Candidate Name aur Category.

  * Koi handle atak jaaye to use list se hata sakte ho.

  * Mapping.xlsx me seedha update kar do to admin panel dobara nahi
    poochhta, aur batata hai ki handle pehle se mapping me hai.


D. HANDLES TO BE ADDED  (dono dashboard par naya tab)
----------------------------------------------------

  * User template download karta hai, handle bharta hai, upload karta
    hai. Upload par turant dikh jaata hai ki kaun sa handle pehle se
    mapping me hai (uska AC/PC, party, sab) aur kaun sa naya hai.
  * Bulk CSV bhi, aur haath se 2-3 entry bhi -- dono.
  * Remarks likh kar request bhej sakta hai.
  * Admin panel par request aati hai, wahan har khaana EDIT ho sakta
    hai, phir Approve ya Reject. Approve par mapping apne aap update.
  * User ko apni request ka haal dikhta rehta hai.

  * (07 Oct) "Send request" dabane par "No valid handle in that file."
    aa jaata tha -- chahe row bilkul theek ho. Yaani koi request ja hi
    nahi rahi thi. Theek ho gaya.


E. ADMIN PANEL KE TAB
---------------------

  * Login Requests + Handle Requests ab ek hi tab me.
  * Scraping Report + Data Export bhi ek hi tab me.


F. DASHBOARD KI TABLE AUR CHART  (07 Oct)
-----------------------------------------

  * "Today" ka alag button har filter bar se hata diya (7 jagah se).
    QUICK dropdown me "Today" pehle ki tarah hai -- wahi se chuno.

  * Har filter bar par ab saaf likha aata hai ki kaun si date se kaun si
    tak chuni hai, jaise:   05 Oct 2026 -> 07 Oct 2026  -  3 days
    (pehle sirf Overview par thi, aur "10-05" jaise ulajhne wale format
     me. Ab mahina naam se aata hai, aur dono din ginte hain.)

  * EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ab date filter maanta hai. Pehle Key Highlights,
    Party Performance aur Sentiment Insights HAMESHA poori range ke
    aankde dikhate the, chaahe upar "Last 3 Days" chuna ho. Ab wahi
    hisaab chune hue dino par hota hai -- usi per-din data se jisse upar
    ke KPI card bante hain.
      - top handle, peak day, state ranking, party ranking: sab badalte hain
      - sentiment ka per-din data kahin store hi nahi hota, isliye wo
        poori range ka rehta hai AUR card par saaf likha aata hai
        "full range" -- taaki galatfehmi na ho
      - sentiment ke percentage ab poore 8 bucket par bante hain
        (pehle sirf Positive+Neutral+Negative par -- isse har % bada
         dikhta tha, jaise Neutral 77% jabki asli 65.8%)

  * "Most Active - Tweets" chart ki jaanch ki: wo pehle se SAHI hai aur
    data se hi banta hai. Pichhle 3 din me Modi ji ke sirf 9 tweet hain
    (tweet-ginti me rank 1031), isliye wo top-6 me nahi aate. Un 3 dino
    me VIEWS par Modi ji rank 1 par hain -- "Top Performers" wale chart
    me dikhte hain. Chart badla nahi gaya, kyunki usme galti nahi thi.

  * Data update hone wale dono message ab English me hain:
      - header ki pill par hover karne par:
        "When the data was last updated"   (pehle Hindi me tha)
      - naya data aane par jo HARA banner aata hai:
        "New data is in - refreshing..."
        (pehle "Naya data aa gaya - refresh ho raha hai")
    Rang, jagah aur kaam waisa ka waisa -- sirf shabd badle.

  * Avg Views/Post aur Avg Likes/Post me "NaN" aa jaata tha jab us
    range me koi post hi nahi hota (0 / 0). Ab 0 aata hai.

  * Jis handle ne us range me kuch post nahi kiya, uski row ab table me
    nahi dikhti. Neeche ek line aa jaati hai, jaise:
      "12 handles hidden - no posts in the selected date range"
    taaki aisa na lage ki handle gayab ho gaya.

  * Top Performers chart chhoti range par khaali ho jaata tha. Usme
    shart thi "kam se kam 10 tweet" -- 6 mahine par theek, par 3 din
    par koi 10 tweet nahi karta. Ab shart range ke hisaab se banti hai:
    3 din par 1, 7 din par 3, 30+ din par 10 (pehle jaisi).

  * FROM / TO ke date box ab sirf tab dikhte hain jab QUICK me
    "Custom" chuna jaaye. Jahan QUICK hai hi nahi, wahan pehle ki
    tarah dikhte rahenge. Kaam me kuch nahi badla.


