F6. HANDLE ANALYTICS -- handle ki list ab A se Z
------------------------------------------------

  * Category chunne par jo HANDLE wali list aati thi, wo tweet ki
    ginti ke hisaab se lagi hoti thi -- isliye kram bemaani lagta tha
    aur kisi ko dhoondhna mushkil tha.
    Ab wo NAAM ke hisaab se A se Z aati hai. Bada/chhota akshar se
    farak nahi padta, aur jis handle ka naam nahi hai uske liye handle
    se kram lagta hai.

  * Saath me ek dikkat aur theek hui: list me zyada se zyada 600
    handle aate the. MLA category me 2,274 handle hain -- A-Z karne
    par baaki sab kat jaate. Ab 3,000 tak aate hain, yaani sabse badi
    category bhi poori dikhti hai.

  * Yahi kram search par bhi lagta hai.


G. MAP-GATE  --  dashboard ab Mapping ko maanta hai  (07 Oct)
------------------------------------------------------------

  Pehle har table SIRF scrape kiye hue tweets se banti thi. Mapping se
  handle hatane par uske purane tweet database me pade rehte the,
  isliye handle table me dikhta hi rehta tha.

  Ab ek nayi file hai:
      DASHBOARD\data\mapping_removed.json
      UP-DASHBOARD\data\mapping_removed.json

  Usme sirf wo handle jaate hain jo Mapping.xlsx se JAAN-BOOJHKAR
  hataye gaye. Gate SIRF usi list ko dekhta hai, aur un handles ko har
  table aur chart se nikal deta hai.

  >> Gate "jo mapping me nahi hai" ko NAHI hatata -- aur ye jaan-boojh
     kar hai. 84 aise handle hain jinke tweets to hain par wo kabhi
     Mapping.xlsx me aaye hi nahi (Narendra Modi, BJP4India, Anupriya
     Patel, Ravi Kishan...). Unhe hatana galat hota.
     Poori list isi folder me hai:
         Mapping_Me_Nahi_Hain_84_Handles_07Oct.csv
     Jo rakhne hain unhe Mapping.xlsx me jod lo (column wahi hain).

  Ye list apne aap bharti hai -- RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat har baar purani
  aur nayi mapping ka farak dekh kar usme likh deti hai, aur jo handle
  wapas mapping me aa jaaye use nikal bhi deti hai. Chahe to file khud
  bhi edit kar sakte ho, seedhi-saadi list hai.

  >> Is package me list KHAALI hai. Yaani install karte hi koi handle
     gayab nahi hoga. Iske baad Mapping.xlsx se jo bhi hataoge, wo
     dashboard se bhi hat jaayega.

  >> Agar is system par mapping_removed.json pehle se hai to script use
     CHHUTI NAHI -- aapki list surakshit rahegi.


