====================================================================
08-OCT (dopahar) -- LEVEL CARD (LS MP / RS MP / MLA CONTESTANTS) ka fix
====================================================================

1) MP ka level wapas aa gaya.
   Nayi Mapping.xlsx me MP ka "Party Designation" khaali (-) hai aur
   mantri-pad "Admin Designation" me (Prime Minister / Cabinet / MOS /
   Top Leaders / NA). Level sirf designation se banta tha, isliye 79 MP
   "Others" me gir gaye the -- Narendra Modi aur Rahul Gandhi samet.
   Ab Category (LS_MP / RS_MP / MLC / MLA / MLA Contestent) se bhi level
   banta hai. LS MP 480 -> 560, RS MP 206 -> 232, Others 289 -> 188.

2) "Mapping me nahi hai" ab kabhi "hata diya" nahi maana jaata.
   rebuild_mapping.py khud se data/mapping_removed.json me kuch NAHI
   jodta. Jo handle nayi mapping me na mile, wo sirf dekhne ke liye
   data/mapping_removed_candidates.json me likhe jaate hain.
   Sach me hatana ho to unhe mapping_removed.json ke "handles" me
   KHUD daalo -- tabhi dashboard se hatenge.

3) Nayi Mapping.xlsx me 79 purane handle nahi hain (12,156 tweets).
   List: Mapping_Me_Nahi_Hain_79_Handles_08Oct.csv
   Ye dashboard par pehle jaise dikhte rahenge.

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\rebuild_mapping.py
Chalane ka tarika: UPDATE_KARO.bat -> RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat -> START_LIVE.bat

====================================================================
08-OCT (shaam) -- LEVEL CARD ka handle count ab MAPPING se (poora count)
====================================================================

Pehle card sirf un handles ko ginta tha jinke tweet mile. Mapping me 31 CM
hain, par @cm_nrangaswamy (Puducherry) ka ek bhi tweet data me nahi aaya --
isliye card 30 dikhata tha. Ab ginti MAPPING se hoti hai:

  - Chief Ministers 31 (jitne mapping me hain)
  - Alias (ek hi handle chhote-bade akshar me) do baar nahi ginta
  - mapping_removed.json me daale handle ginti me nahi aate
  - Jo bada ho WAHI dikhta hai: mapping ka count ya tweet-data ka count
    (79 handle aise hain jo mapping me nahi par tweet unke hain)
  - Tweet ka number waisa hi -- wo asli data se aata hai

Saath me: level (pad) ab page bante waqt mapping se theek hota hai, isliye
