====================================================================
09-OCT (9) -- Sentiment Insights ab sach me party/date filter maanta hai
====================================================================

SHIKAYAT: party ya date badlo, Sentiment Insights ka aankda wahi ka wahi.

ASLI WAJAH (chhoti si, par poori baat):
   Blob is tarah aata hai -->   const SENT_DAILY = "...";
   JavaScript me `const` SIRF usi <script> block ke andar dikhta hai.
   Sentiment Insights ka code DOOSRE <script> block me hai, isliye wahan
   window.SENT_DAILY khaali (undefined) milta tha. Code chupchaap peeche
   hat kar poore daur ka aankda (UNI.sent) dikha deta tha -- na koi error,
   na koi nishaan. Isi liye date badalne se kuch nahi hota tha.
   (Yahi jaal pehle D aur UNI ke saath bhi tha -- unka export pehle se
    laga hua hai; ab SENT_DAILY ka bhi laga diya.)

ILAAJ: const ke theek neeche, usi block me --
   try{window.SENT_DAILY=SENT_DAILY;}catch(e){}

AB KYA HOTA HAI:
   * Party nahi chuni + date range  -> us range ka PAKKA aankda
                                       (SENT_DAILY ke per-din ginti se)
   * Party chuni + poora daur       -> us party ka PAKKA aankda
   * Party chuni + chhoti range     -> ANDAAZA: har handle ka sentiment
                                       usi anupaat me liya jaata hai
                                       jitne uske tweet un dino me hain.
                                       Footer par saaf "approx." likha
                                       jaata hai (hover karo to wajah).
   Footer har baar batata hai: kitne tweets, kaunsi party, kaunsa daur.

   Wajah ki per-din sentiment pipeline me STATE-wise jama hota hai,
   PARTY-wise nahi. Agar aage chal kar party-wise bhi chahiye to pipeline
   me jodna padega -- bata dijiyega, chhota kaam hai.

JAANCH: naya t_fin4.js -- template ka asli code, asli blob data par
   chalta hai aur sach me ginti karke milata hai:
     3 din            = 48,961 tweets   (poori range 20,59,344)
     BJP poora daur   = 15,58,588       (UNI.party.BJP se bilkul milta hai)
     BJP + 3 din      = 37,350          (approx. ka thappa lagta hai)
   Chaaron haalat ka card alag dikhta hai.

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
                UP-DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
Sirf Ctrl + F5 kaafi hai (server.js is baar nahi badla).


====================================================================
09-OCT (10) -- HAR TABLE ke column header par filter (Explorer jaisa)
====================================================================

Windows File Explorer ki tarah ab har data table ke column header par
chhota chevron (v) aata hai. Hover karo to dikhta hai; filter lagte hi
hamesha dikhta hai aur header orange ho jaata hai.

KIS COLUMN PAR KYA MILTA HAI:
  Text (State, PC/AC Name, Party, Designation, Name/Handle)
      -> search box + checkbox list (har value ke saamne ginti)
         + "Select all" / "Clear"
  Number (Followers, Tweets, Views, Avg Views/Post ...)
      -> Sort 1->9 / 9->1  aur  Min-Max range
         (2.35 Cr / 1.80 L / 4.2K jaise number bhi theek samjhe jaate hain)
  Date (Last Updated jaisa koi bhi column)
      -> Oldest / Newest  aur  from - to
  "#" column -> koi filter nahi; filter ke baad number dubara 1 se.

AUR:
  * Kai column ek saath = AND (State = Delhi AND Party = BJP).
  * Table ke upar patti: "Showing 25 of 540 rows", lage hue filter ke
    chip (chip par x dabao to wahi filter hatta hai), aur
    "Clear all filters".
  * Popup Esc se ya bahar click karne se band; ek waqt me ek hi.
  * Popup page par alag se lagta hai, isliye table ke scroll me kat-ta
    nahi -- aur phone par bhi screen ke andar hi rehta hai.
  * Jo table dashboard khud dubara banata hai (date/party filter ya sort
    dabane par), uspar filter apne aap wapas lag jaata hai.
  * Export ab filter ke baad wali rows deta hai.

KAUNSI TABLE CHHODI GAYI (jaanbujhkar):
  - "Handles To Be Added" wali bharne wali table (usme input box hain)
  - Report preview / PDF wali table
  - Handle Analytics ka "Latest Tweets" (wo server se page-by-page aata
    hai, to sirf dikhne wale page par filter lagana dhoka hota)
  - 2-3 row wali chhoti table (wahan filter bematlab hai)

DARK THEME: aapne kaha tha nahi chahiye -- is feature me koi dark rule
nahi daala gaya.

JAANCH: asli Chrome me 38 jaanch chalayi gayi (filter, AND, range, sort,
clear, popup, re-render ke baad filter bachna, mobile, raftaar, console) --
sab paas. Project me t_colf.js (88 jaanch) bhi juda.
Sample file: SAMPLE_col_filters\column_filters_sample.html (sirf dekhne ke
liye, dashboard isse nahi chalta).

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
                UP-DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
Sirf Ctrl + F5 kaafi hai (server.js nahi badla).


====================================================================
10-OCT -- Dashboard ab ek baar banta hai (speed + crash se bachav)
====================================================================

DIKKAT KYA THI:
  Har page load par poora kaam DOBARA hota tha --
     * Mongo se ~8 MB data uthana
     * template padhna, 17 blob chipkaana
     * 7-9 MB ki string banana, phir use gzip karna
  Lagbhag 1.5-2 second CPU, aur Node ek hi thread par -- isliye log
  kataar me lag jaate the. Aur har request ~130 MB ka kooda banati thi,
  to 25-30 log ek saath aate hi memory bhar kar SERVER GIR JAATA tha.
  Girne ke baad khud wapas nahi aata tha -- koi jaa kar START_LIVE.bat
  dobara chalata, tab tak dashboard band.

AB KYA HOTA HAI (2 badlaav):

1. DASH-CACHE -- page ek baar banta hai
   Bhaari hissa (jo har user ke liye bilkul ek jaisa hai) ek baar ban kar
   memory me rehta hai. Naya tabhi banta hai jab:
       - pipeline naya data laaye (meta.lastUpdate badle), ya
       - dashboard.template.html badle  (yaani template edit + Ctrl+F5
         ab bhi pehle jaisa hi kaam karta hai)
   Taiyaar GZIP buffer bhi cache hota hai, isliye dobara kholne ya
   refresh karne par kaam lagbhag shoonya -- bas buffer bhej dena.

   SABSE ZAROORI: ek waqt me EK hi build chalta hai. 200 request ek saath
   aa jaayein to build ek hi hoga, baaki usi ka intezaar karenge.
   Pehle 200 build ek saath chalte the -- yahi crash ki asli jad thi.

   Cache khud saaf hota hai. Zabardasti saaf karna ho to:  /refresh

   Kaam kar raha hai ya nahi, ye dekho:   http://localhost:3000/api/build
   Usme ab "cache" bhi aata hai:
       builds     -> ab tak kitni baar page bana (kam hona chahiye)
       gzHits     -> kitni baar taiyaar page seedha bheja gaya (zyada)
       gzMiss     -> kitni baar naya banana pada
       gzMB       -> cache ne kitni memory li
   Dashboard do-teen baar refresh karo -- builds wahi rahega aur gzHits
   badhta jaayega. Yahi iska sabut hai.

2. AUTO-RESTART -- server gir jaaye to khud wapas
   Nayi file: DASHBOARD\RUN_SERVER.bat
   Ye server ko loop me chalati hai. Kabhi gir jaaye to 5 second me khud
   dobara chalu. Window ka naam "All-India Dashboard Server" hoga.
   Server band hi rakhna ho to us window ko X se band kar dein.
   Saath me Node ki memory hadd 3 GB aur gzip ke liye zyada thread.

   START_LIVE.bat me ek line badalni padti hai -- par wo file aapke
   system ki apni hai (usme aapka Python path aur ngrok ka token hai),
   isliye use package me NAHI bheja gaya. Uski jagah ek chhoti file hai:

       DASHBOARD\PATCH_START_LIVE.bat     <-- ek hi baar chalani hai

   Ye aapki START_LIVE.bat me sirf wahi ek line badalti hai, backup
   bhi bana deti hai (START_LIVE.bat.bak_before_autorestart), aur baaki
   sab -- Python path, ngrok domain/token, ghante wala loop -- waise ke
   waise chhod deti hai. Dobara chalao to kuch nahi hota.

KITNA FARAK PADEGA:
       aaj                       ->  5-10 log ek saath, 30 par crash
       in badlaav ke baad        ->  50-80 log (upload speed par nirbhar)
                                     crash nahi, error nahi
  Asli naap: 200 request ek saath -> 405 ms me sab, 0 error (RAM se).

JAANCH: naya t_colf/t_cache -- 56 jaanch, aur poora suite FAIL 0.

CHALANE KA TARIKA (is baar 4 kadam):
   1. UPDATE_KARO.bat
   2. DASHBOARD\PATCH_START_LIVE.bat      <-- ek hi baar, auto-restart ke liye
   3. START_LIVE.bat band karke dobara chalao   (server.js badla hai)
      startup par "BUILD: 2026-10-10 dash-cache ..." dikhna chahiye
   4. Browser me Ctrl + F5

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\server.js
Nayi file:      DASHBOARD\RUN_SERVER.bat
                DASHBOARD\PATCH_START_LIVE.bat


