10-OCT (2) -- Mapping hi sach: bahar wale handle hide + designation
====================================================================

DO SHIKAYATEIN THIN:
  1. Top Leaders me kuch handle dikhte the jo Mapping.xlsx me hain hi nahi
     (kuch ka to naam bhi "nan" dikhta tha)
  2. Jo mapping me hain unki designation galat -- @BJP4India ki Category
     mapping me "Page" hai par chip "Leader" dikha raha tha

-------- 1. MAPPING ME NAHI = DASHBOARD PAR NAHI --------

Pehle code me jaanbujhkar likha tha: "mapping me nahi hai -- itna kaafi
nahi", kyunki 84 handle aise the jinke tweet to the par wo Mapping.xlsx me
the hi nahi (Narendra Modi jaise), aur unhe hatana galat hota.

08-Oct ke baad wo wajah khatam ho gayi -- Category se bhi level banne laga
aur Modi, Rahul, Amit Shah, Yogi sab mapping me aa gaye. Jaanch ki to
sirf 112 handle bache the jo sach me mapping me nahi hain (112 me se
sirf 2 me "_" ka farak tha, baaki 110 bilkul gayab).

Ab seedha niyam: MAPPING ME NAHI = DASHBOARD PAR NAHI.

  * 112 handle hide ho gaye (31 to wahi the jinka naam "nan" dikhta tha)
  * Un sab ke 30,473 tweets ab ginti me nahi (kul ka 1.5%)
  * MongoDB me data waise ka waisa pada hai -- KUCH MITA NAHI
  * Mapping.xlsx me jodte hi handle apne aap wapas dikhne lagega

  Poori list: UPDATE_07-OCT\MAPPING_ME_NAHI_110_HANDLES_10Oct.csv

  SAARE JOD AAPAS ME MILTE HAIN (ye khaas dhyan se kiya gaya):
  handle sirf table se hatana kaafi nahi hota -- Dashboard tab ke chart
  aur KPI alag jagah se jod lete hain, to table me handle gayab hota aur
  chart me uske tweet shaamil -- do alag-alag number. Isliye D.handles se
  bhi hataya gaya, aur party-wise per-din jod me se un handles ka hissa
  PHD (per-handle per-din aankde) se ghata diya gaya.
      tweets : allHandles 20,29,144 = partyDaily 20,29,144  (milte hain)
      views  : dono taraf 7,19,79,06,160                    (milte hain)

-------- 2. DESIGNATION KA CHIP AB MAPPING SE --------

Chip pehle HROLE blob se aata tha, jo pipeline banati hai. Ab mapping ka
pad upar rakha jaata hai:
      1. Designation (kai hon to "Chief Minister / MLA")
      2. Designation na ho to Category   (@BJP4India -> "Page")

  Misaalein (asli data par jaanch ki gayi):
      @BJP4India        Leader  ->  Page
