====================================================================
10-OCT (3) -- Har table ka apna scroll (page ruka rehta hai)
====================================================================

KYA HOTA HAI AB:
  * Maus/ungli TABLE par ho aur scroll karein -> sirf ROWS chalti hain,
    poora page apni jagah par ruka rehta hai.
  * Table ke BAHAR scroll karein -> page pehle jaisa hi chalta hai.
  * Table ke ANT tak pahunch kar aur scroll karein -> page phir bhi nahi
    khiskta (yahi "overscroll contain" hai -- scroll page ko pakadta nahi).
  * Header hamesha dikhta rehta hai (chipka hua).
  * Jin table me bahut column hain, unka dayein-bayein scroll bhi usi
    dibbe me hota hai -- page ko chaudai me nahi kheenchta.
  * Row kam hon to dibba apni asli unchai leta hai -- koi khaali jagah
    nahi, koi bekaar ka scrollbar nahi.
  * Scrollbar patla aur halka hai, dashboard ke rang se milta hua.

UNCHAI EK HI JAGAH SE BADALTI HAI:
  CSS me  :root{--table-max-height:70vh}
  Chhoti chahiye to 70vh ki jagah 50vh ya 420px kar dein -- SAARI table
  ek saath badal jaayengi. Design, rang, badge, font, gol kone -- kuch
  nahi badla, sirf scroll ka vyavhaar juda hai.

KAUNSI TABLE CHHODI GAYI (jaanbujhkar):
  - "Handles To Be Added" wali bharne wali table (usme input box hain)
  - Report preview / PDF wali table (print tootta)
  - Profile wala popup aur AI chat
  Print karte waqt table poori chhap jaati hai (@media print me scroll hat
  jaata hai) -- aadhi table nahi chhapegi.

DO CHHOTI PAR ZAROORI BAATEIN (ye khud pakadni padin):

  1. Sticky header ka border gayab ho jaata hai.
     border-collapse:collapse ke saath position:sticky lagane par Chrome
     header ki neeche wali line scroll me kha jaata hai. Isliye wo line
     ab border se nahi, inset shadow se banti hai -- dikhne me bilkul wahi.

  2. Column filter ki patti ("Showing 25 of 540 rows") dibbe ke BAHAR
     rehni chahiye, warna wo bhi rows ke saath upar chali jaati aur dikhna
     band ho jaati. Isliye lapetne me SIRF <table> andar jaata hai, aur
     col-filter wala code apni patti dibbe se pehle lagata hai.

  Teesri baat: .tbl-box aur .data-table-wrap par pehle se overflow-x:auto
  tha. Ab wo kaam andar wala dibba karta hai, warna do-do scrollbar aate.

JAANCH: asli Chrome me 30 jaanch -- template ka ASLI CSS+JS nikaal kar:
  maus table par -> rows 0->320 chalin, page scrollY 0->0 (bilkul nahi hila)
  table ke ant par aur scroll -> page phir bhi 0
  bahar scroll -> page chala
  420px scroll ke baad bhi header dibbe ke sabse upar (farak 0.0px)
  3 row wali table -> scrollbar nahi (139px = 139px)
  filter ke saath, mobile par, aur baad me bani table par bhi theek
  koi console error nahi
Project me t_tscroll.js (63 jaanch) bhi juda. Poora suite: 42 JS + 4 Python,
FAIL 0.
Sample file: SAMPLE_table_scroll\table_scroll_sample.html (sirf dekhne ke liye)

CHALANE KA TARIKA:
   1. UPDATE_KARO.bat
   2. Browser me Ctrl + F5         <-- server.js nahi badla, restart nahi chahiye

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
                UP-DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html


========================================================================
10-OCT (4) -- Header ki do animation (swoosh wave + logo coin flip)
========================================================================

KYA BADLA:
  Header ka design bilkul nahi badla -- na rang, na font, na jagah, na
  shabd. Sirf do animation jodi gayi hain.

  1. SWOOSH WAVE
     - Page khulte hi kesari wave aur uske upar ki golden line baayein se
       andar aati hai -- 1.5 second, ease-out. Uske turant baad title,
       chips aur Admin button ek-ek karke halke se ubharte hain.
     - Uske baad wave hamesha ke liye bahut halki si chalti rehti hai:
       8 second ka ek chakkar, 6 unit ki drift aur 1.4% ka morph. Itni
       dhimi ki dhyaan nahi kheenchti, par header zinda lagta hai.
     - Golden line par ek chamak baayein se daayein chalti rehti hai
       (7 second). Ye chamak SIRF transform se bani hai: ek chhoti khidki
       aage chalti hai aur andar ka stroke utna hi ulta, isliye line khud
       hilti nahi aur browser ko kuch dobara banana nahi padta.
     - Wave pehle se hi text ke PEECHE hai (wave 0, text 2) aur click
       nahi kha sakti, isliye padhne me kabhi dikkat nahi.

  2. LOGO COIN FLIP
     - Logo par click (ya mobile par tap) karte hi wo sikke ki tarah poora
       360 degree ghoomta hai -- 0.9 second, beech me zara sa bada hota
       hai, jaise asli sikka uchhla ho.
     - Tab se logo chun kar Enter ya Space se bhi ghoomta hai, aur Space
       se page scroll nahi hota.
     - Flip chalte waqt dobara click kaam nahi karta; khatam hote hi phir
       chal jaata hai. Gol shape aur golden border jyon ke tyon rehte hain.

  3. SPLASH LOADER KE BAAD CHALTI HAI (zaroori sudhaar)
     Pehli baar jab ye laga to intro dikhti hi nahi thi -- kyunki page
     khulte hi wo chal padti thi, aur us waqt upar splash loader (#loader)
     chhaya hota hai. 1.5 second ki intro loader ke PEECHE khatam ho jaati
     thi, aur loader hatne par wave pehle se hi apni jagah par hoti thi.
     Ab saari animation shuru me ruki (paused) rehti hain. Jaise hi loader
     par hiding class lagti hai, body par hdr-go lag jaata hai aur tabhi
     intro chalti hai -- yani user ko poori dikhti hai.
     hideLoader() ko haath nahi lagaya: header-anim khud MutationObserver
     se loader par nazar rakhta hai. Agar kisi wajah se loader kabhi na
     hate, to 7 second ka fallback hai -- header phir bhi dikh jaayega.
     Jinke yahan animation band hai (reduced-motion), unke liye ye gate
     bemaani hai -- unka header pehle se hi poora dikhta hai.

TIMING BADALNI HO TO:
  Sirf 5 CSS variable, ek hi jagah (:root me) --
     --swoosh-intro-duration    1.5s
     --swoosh-idle-duration     8s
     --swoosh-shimmer-duration  7s
     --logo-flip-duration       .9s
     --hdr-fade-duration        .65s

DHYAAN DENE WALI BAATEN:
  Jinke computer par "animation band" setting lagi hai
  (prefers-reduced-motion), unke yahan intro, drift aur chamak apne aap
  band rehti hain aur logo ka flip ek chhote fade me badal jaata hai.

  PDF / report capture ke waqt header par hdr-capturing class lag jaati
  hai, jisse animation ek pal ke liye ruk jaati hai -- isliye image me
  wave hamesha apni asli jagah par aati hai.

JAANCH: asli Chromium me 45 jaanch, DONO template ke liye alag-alag,
  template ka ASLI CSS + markup + JS nikaal kar:
     intro: wave -525 par shuru -> 1.5s baad theek 0 par
     drift: 3.6 unit, scaleY 1.008 -- utni hi halki
     chamak: khidki aur stroke ka jod 0.00 (stroke hila hi nahi)
     title ke pixel par elementFromPoint = logo-text (wave upar nahi aayi)
     saare keyframes me sirf transform/opacity
     animation ke dauraan header ka box bilkul same -- koi layout shift nahi
     desktop aur 390px mobile -- koi horizontal scrollbar nahi
     flip: beech me m11 = -1.100 aur is2D = false (asli 3D), ant me saamne
     dobara-click band, Enter/Space, aur reduced-motion -- sab theek
     koi console error nahi
  Splash gate par 17 aur jaanch (asli loader ke saath, dono template):
     loader ke peeche animation paused aur wave -820 par hi rahi
     loader hatte hi (2236ms) hdr-go laga aur intro CHALTI hui dikhi
     300ms baad wave -188 par (yani beech me), phir 0 par aakar ruki
     loader ke bina -> turant chalu; reduced-motion me header turant poora
Project me t_hdranim.js (161 jaanch) bhi juda. Poora suite: 41 JS +
4 Python, FAIL 0.
Sample file: SAMPLE_header_anim\header_anim_sample.html (sirf dekhne ke liye)

CHALANE KA TARIKA:
   1. UPDATE_KARO.bat
   2. Browser me Ctrl + F5         <-- server.js nahi badla, restart nahi chahiye

Badli hui file: DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html
                UP-DASHBOARD\dashboard.template.html


========================================================================
10-OCT (5) -- Parties tab naye sire se + mapping ka cache fix
========================================================================

A. PARTY KPI CARD

  HATA DIYA: card ke andar ka "Sentiment Breakdown" (wo 8 patti wali
  list). Sentiment ab SIRF neeche wale "Sentiment by Party" chart me
  hai -- waha poori 8 category, legend, aur tooltip me count + % dono.

  JAISA THA WAISA HI: party ka badge, naam, poora naam, handles ki
  ginti, aur Tweets / Views / Likes / Retweets ke 4 box.

  NAYA: Total Followers aur Total Following ke do box (usi style me),
  aur uske neeche "Handles by Designation" ke chhote tile.
     - tile MAPPING se bante hain (handle_master.json -> HROLE), kisi
       fixed list se nahi. Jiska pad mapping me nahi likha, uske liye
       uska level dikh jaata hai.
     - jis handle ke do pad hain (jaise "Prime Minister / LS MP"), wo
       DONO me gina jaata hai, aur card ke neeche chhota sa note aata
       hai: "a handle can hold multiple designations".
     - 0 wale tile nahi dikhte. Mapping me kai bar 20-25 alag-alag pad
       hote hain, isliye upar ke 8 tile dikhte hain aur baaki ek
       "+N more roles" me sameta jaata hai -- uspar maus le jaane se
       poori list naam aur ginti ke saath dikh jaati hai.
     - desktop par 3 tile ek line me, mobile par 2.
  Ek row ke saare card ab barabar unchai ke hote hain.

B. FILTER (Date Range -> Level -> State -> Party)

  Date Range ke option ab is kram me: Full Range, Today, Yesterday,
  3 Days, 7 Days, Custom. Today/Yesterday/3/7 IST se gine jaate hain.
  Custom tabhi lagta hai jab dono date chun li jayein.

  Chaaron dropdown ek doosre se bandhe hain: har dropdown me sirf wahi
  option aate hain jinke paas pehle wale chunav ke saath sach me data
  hai. Purana chunav valid ho to bacha rehta hai, warna default par
  chala jaata hai. Kuch na mile to saaf likha aata hai "No data for
  this selection" -- khaali ya toota hua card/chart nahi.

  Level ke option ab DATA se bante hain (pehle HTML me fixed likhe the
  LS_MP / RS_MP / CM / DyCM, jabki data me LS MP, RS MP, Chief
  Minister, Dy CM, MLA, MLC, Others hain -- isliye wo chalte hi nahi
  the).

C. KAUN SA NUMBER KIS FILTER SE BADALTA HAI

  Tweets aur Views        -> Level/State/Party AUR Date, dono se.
                             Ye roz ka data hai, isliye BILKUL THEEK.
  Likes aur Retweets      -> Level/State/Party se theek. Date range par
                             tweet-share se baante jaate hain, isliye
                             box par chhota "approx." likha aata hai
                             (sirf tab, jab poora range na chuna ho).
  Sentiment               -> waisa hi: date range par approx.
  Followers / Following   -> JAAN-BOOJH KAR date se nahi bandhe. Ye
                             snapshot hain ("us hafte ke followers"
                             hote hi nahi). Ye sirf is baat par
                             nirbhar hain ki kaun se handle chune gaye.
  Hourly Pattern          -> kisi filter se nahi badalta, aur chart ke
                             neeche yahi saaf likha hai. Ghante-war
                             data party/state/din ke hisaab se kahin
                             store hi nahi hota (sirf ek global curve
                             hai). Isko exact banane ke liye pipeline
                             badalni padegi -- aapne abhi rehne diya.

D. PARTY CHUNNE KA TARIKA

  Kuch na chuna      -> saare card, aur chart me sab milakar.
  Dropdown se chuni  -> sirf us party ka card; chart us party par.
  Card par click     -> BAAKI CARD BHI DIKHTE RAHTE HAIN, sirf click
                        kiya hua card apne rang se ghir jaata hai aur
                        neeche ke chart us party par chale jaate hain.
                        Wahi card dobara = deselect. Card ke andar
                        stat box ya designation tile par click bhi
                        wahi card chunta hai.
  Dropdown ka hak upar hai: dropdown badalte hi card ka chunav saaf.
  Filter badalne par agar chuni hui party bachi hi nahi, to chunav
  apne aap hat jaata hai. Upar chhoti chip hamesha batati hai:
  "Showing: BJP" ya "Showing: All Parties".

E. CHART

  - "Daily Tweet Activity" ke apne All / Last 7D / Last 3D button HATA
    diye -- wo upar wale Date Range se ladte the. Ab ek hi maalik hai.
  - Chart ke subtitle ki date ab chune hue range se banti hai; koi
    fixed "Apr-Jul 2026" nahi bacha.
  - Chhote range (Today / Yesterday / 3 Days) par Daily chart ka
    x-axis GHANTE ka ho jaata hai; lambe range par label apne aap kam
    ho jaate hain, isliye aapas me chipakte nahi.
  - Views Share / Tweets / Sentiment: ek party chunne par bhi SAARI
    party dikhti hain -- chuni hui apne rang me, baaki halki grey.
    (Warna donut 100% ka ek bekaar tukda ban jaata tha.)
  - Data me 70+ party hain. Chart me top 8 + "Others" dikhte hain
    (Others ka jod poora bachta hai, kuch gira nahi). Card me top 12
    dikhte hain aur neeche "Show all 71 parties" ka button hai.
  - Pehle in 4 chart ke numbers HTML me HARDCODE pade the. Ab sab
    asli handles se bante hain -- isliye kuch numbers badle hue
    dikhenge; pehle wale galat the.

F. MAPPING KA CACHE FIX (server.js)

  Designation/party/level mapping se serve ke waqt chipakte hain,
  isliye inhe badalne ke liye pipeline chalane ki zaroorat nahi. Par
  dash-cache ko iski khabar nahi thi: uski key me sirf pipeline ka
  lastUpdate aur template ki tareekh thi. Isliye Mapping.xlsx badalne
  ke baad bhi purana bana-banaya page milta rehta tha.
  Ab handle_master.json ki tareekh bhi key me hai, aur mapping sync ke
  turant baad bana-banaya page phenk diya jaata hai. Matlab mapping
  badli -> agle Ctrl+F5 par naya designation.

G. MLA TRACKER -- dohri designation hat gayi

  MLA Tracker ki table me jis handle ka asli pad CM/Dy CM hai, uske
  saamne ek aur "MLA" ka chip apne aap lag jaata tha. Wo tab zaroori
  tha jab mapping se sirf EK pad aata tha (jaise sirf "CM") -- batana
  padta tha ki ye MLA bhi hai. Ab mapping khud "MLA / Chief Minister"
  deti hai, to wahi baat do baar dikhti thi:
        [ MLA / Chief Minister ]
        [ MLA ]
  Ab wo extra chip tabhi lagta hai jab designation me MLA pehle se
  likha na ho. "Chief Minister" ya "Dy CM" jaise maamlo me do chip
  waisa hi rahega -- wahan MLA batana sach me zaroori hai.

H. DESIGNATION KA COLUMN AB PATLA

  Mapping se ab lambe pad aate hain -- jaise "Deputy Chief Minister /
  MLA Contestent" ya "Chairman, Media & Publicity Dept / National
  Spokesperson". Teen jagah par chip me white-space:nowrap likha tha,
  isliye ye ek hi line me khinch jaate the aur Designation ka column
  poori table ko chauda kar deta tha:
     States & CM ki table (.td-desig)
     MLA Tracker (_mlaDesigCell)
     Leader Board ka chip
  Ab teeno lipat jaate hain (max 124-132px). Top Leaders pehle se hi
  lipatta tha -- wo waisa hi hai.

JAANCH: asli Chromium me 71 jaanch, ASLI data ke saath -- template me
  Mongo ka poora data bhar kar (9.5 MB, 3289 handle, 71 party):
     har card ke handles / tweets / following / designation UNI aur D
       se ALAG SE ginkar milaye -- sab theek
     7 Days par tweets theek, approx. nishaan aaya, followers nahi badle
     Today -> 24 ghante, 3 Days -> 72 ghante, Full -> 192 din
     cascading: CM chunne par sirf wahi state, phir sirf wahi party
     Case A / B / C, deselect, tile aur stat box par click, chip
     Sentiment ki har party ki har category ka number sach
     Others milakar poora total bachta hai
     Top Leaders aur UP tab bhi bina kisi error ke khule
     mobile 390px, aur ek row ke card barabar unchai ke
  mla-dup par 12 aur jaanch (asli MLA Tracker table me HROLE badal kar):
     "MLA / Chief Minister", "Chief Minister / MLA", chhote akshar wala
       "mla / chief minister", aur "MLA Contestant" -> sab par EK hi chip
     "Chief Minister" aur "Dy CM" -> do chip (purana kaam bacha)
     poori table me kahin dohri designation nahi
  desig-wrap par 13 aur jaanch: har handle ko lamba pad dekar Top
