========================================================================
10-OCT (6) -- PUNJAB : assistant hataya + pipeline me catch-up
========================================================================

A. "POLITICAL LENS ASSISTANT" HAT GAYA (sirf Punjab se)

  Punjab dashboard se wo floating chat button aur uska popup poori tarah
  hata diya gaya -- markup, JavaScript aur CSS, teeno.
     public\index.html     -- button + popup ka block nikala
     public\assistant.js    -- khaali kar di (asli content _removed_assistant\ me)
     public\assistant-ai.js -- khaali kar di
     public\ai-settings.js  -- NAYI
     public\wire.js         -- wireAssistant() hataya
     public\style.css       -- assistant ka ~4,900 akshar ka CSS hataya
     server.js              -- POST /api/ask hataya

  JO JAAN-BOOJH KAR BACHAYA (warna Reports tab tooth jaata):
     /api/ai/status, /api/ai/key, /api/ai/models, /api/ai/narrative
     Settings ka Gemini key + model panel
  assistant-ai.js me chat ke saath Settings ka panel bhi pada tha. Isliye
  use delete nahi kiya -- do hisson me kaat kar Settings wala hissa nayi
  file ai-settings.js me nikal liya. Settings card ka text ab Reports ke
  baare me hai, assistant ke nahi.

  Doosre kisi dashboard ka assistant NAHI chhua.

B. PIPELINE : PUNJAB AB PEECHE NAHI REH SAKTA

  Pehle kya hota tha:
     run_pipeline.py me All India + UP + Punjab teeno ek saath push hote
     hain. Par Punjab agar FAIL ho jaata (build crash, python na mile,
     Mongo timeout) to wo bas ek line log me likh kar chup ho jaata tha.
     Uske turant baad "sab ho gaya" maan liya jaata tha. Agle ghante agar
     koi nayi file na aati to raasta yahan se jaata tha --
         if added == 0 and not pending:  ->  "Naya data nahi -> push skip."
     -- aur Punjab wahin ka wahin reh jaata, jabki All India aur UP taaza
     ho chuke hote. Bina kisi warning ke.

  Ab:
     Punjab fail hone par .punjab_pending ka nishaan lag jaata hai, aur
     agle run me -- chahe ek bhi nayi file na aayi ho -- SIRF Punjab
     akela dobara push ho jaata hai.

  Dhyaan rahe: Punjab pehle se hi All India ka filter view hai aur usi
  ghante wali cycle par chalta hai. Ye badlav usse tez nahi karta --
  bas us ek haalat ko theek karta hai jisme wo chup-chaap peeche reh
  jaata tha.

JAANCH:
  Assistant hatane ki jaanch asli Chromium me, 17 jaanch: button, popup,
  input, "Political Lens Assistant" text, dono script file aur poora CSS
  -- sab gayab; Settings ka key panel, model dropdown, Save/Clear, status
  tag aur Reports ka AI button -- sab salaamat; koi JS error nahi.
  Catch-up ki jaanch: push_punjab() ko asli file se nikaal kar nakli
  subprocess ke saath chalaya (koi asli build nahi, Mongo ko haath nahi) --
     push theek chala      -> True, nishaan hat gaya
     push fail (code 1)    -> False, nishaan LAG gaya
     poora crash           -> False, nishaan lag gaya
     sirf refresh fail     -> True (push to ho hi gaya tha)
     agla run, nayi file nahi, nishaan laga -> Punjab akela push hua
Project me t_pjcatch.py (31 jaanch) juda. Poora suite: 42 JS + 5 Python,
FAIL 0.

SAATH ME EK CHECK SCRIPT:
  PunjabLens\_fix\CHECK_PUNJAB_DATA.bat  -- sirf PADHTA hai. Batata hai
  source me Punjab ka kitna data hai, sabse naya din, pichhle 24 ghante
  aur 7 din me kitna aaya, political_lens me kya bana, dashboard ke teen
  number milte hain ya nahi, aur duplicate/khaali field/date format.
  (Ye package me nahi jaata -- sirf is system par hai.)

CHALANE KA TARIKA:
   1. UPDATE_KARO.bat
   2. START_LIVE.bat band karke DOBARA chalao   <-- server.js + pipeline badli
   3. Browser me Ctrl + F5  (teeno par: / , /up , /punjab/)

