========================================================================
12-OCT -- "Cannot GET /punjab/" ka fix (Punjab ab package se khud banta hai)
========================================================================

DIKKAT:
  Main system par chaaro step chalane ke baad /punjab/ kholne par
  "Cannot GET /punjab/" aa raha tha.

WAJAH:
  Main server Punjab ko aise jodta hai (DASHBOARD\server.js, line ~1921):

      try {
        var punjabApp = require('../PunjabLens/server.js');
        app.use('/punjab', punjabApp);
        console.log('  Punjab dashboard juda: /punjab  (db: political_lens)');
      } catch (e) {
        console.log('  [PUNJAB] mount skip: ' + e.message);
      }

  Wo require fail ho jaye to /punjab ka route banta hi nahi, aur Express
  seedha "Cannot GET" de deta hai. Chala kar dono haalat dohrayi gayin:

      PunjabLens\node_modules nahi   ->  mount skip: Cannot find module 'express'
      PunjabLens folder hi nahi      ->  mount skip: Cannot find module '...server.js'

  Pehle package me Punjab ki sirf 8 file thi (HTML/CSS/JS + server.js).
  Wo tabhi kaam karti jab Punjab us system par pehle se laga ho. Main
  system par laga hi nahi tha -- isliye UPDATE_KARO.bat ne Punjab ka
  hissa chhod diya aur page par "Cannot GET" aata raha.

AB:
  Package me Punjab ki SAARI source files hain -- 31 files:
     server.js, aggregate.js, build_punjab_data.py, mongo_conf.js,
     mongo_conf.py, package.json, package-lock.json, requirements.txt,
     UPDATE_DATA.bat, config.json, aur poora public\ (18 file +
     assets\lib\xlsx.full.min.js)
  UPDATE_KARO.bat folder na hone par ab khud bana deta hai, aur baad me
  jaanch kar ke batata hai ki node packages lagane baaki hain ya nahi.

  NAYI FILE: PunjabLens\SETUP_PUNJAB.bat
     Ek baar chalani hai. express + mongodb install karti hai (npm),
     phir jaanch kar ke batati hai sab theek hai ya nahi. Dobara chalao
     to khud keh deti hai "pehle se lage hue hain".

  NAHI BHEJE (jaan-boojh kar):
     node_modules   -- 100+ MB, SETUP_PUNJAB.bat khud laata hai
     ai_config.json -- usme Gemini key hoti hai. Na ho to Reports ka AI
                       band rahega, baaki sab chalega. Key Settings se
                       daal dena.
     .session_secret, START.bat, SCHEDULE_DAILY.bat
                    -- Punjab ab main server ke andar chalta hai, iski
                       apni window ki zaroorat nahi.
     config.json BHEJI hai par ":ifmiss" se -- jo pehle se ho use chhua
     nahi jaata, taaki aapki settings na mite.

JAANCH:
  Package wali Punjab files se ek KHAALI jagah par taaza install banaya
  (31 files + node_modules) aur usi tarah require kiya jaise main server
  karta hai:
     require OK          -> function
     startBuildWatcher   -> function
     CFG.targetDb        -> political_lens
     13 routes bane; /api/data aur /api/status maujood
     POST /api/ask HAT chuka hai (assistant wala)
     POST /api/ai/narrative maujood (Reports ka AI)
  index.html jo 15 file maangti hai, sab package me hain.

CHALANE KA TARIKA (main system par, isi kram me):
   1. UPDATE_07-OCT\UPDATE_KARO.bat
   2. DASHBOARD\RUN_MAPPING_UPDATE.bat
   3. DASHBOARD\PATCH_START_LIVE.bat
   4. PunjabLens\SETUP_PUNJAB.bat        <-- NAYA, sirf pehli baar
   5. DASHBOARD\START_LIVE.bat
   6. Ctrl + F5  (/ , /up , /punjab/)

  START_LIVE ki window me ye line dikhni chahiye:
      Punjab dashboard juda: /punjab  (db: political_lens)
  Uski jagah "[PUNJAB] mount skip: ..." dikhe to wahi line bhej dena --
  usme asli wajah likhi hoti hai.


================================================================================
  12-OCT (2)  --  Fix.md ke 5 kaam (All India + UP dono)
================================================================================

(1) LOADER KA CHIP
    All India par "STATES" likha aata tha -- usme Delhi, J&K jaise UT bhi
    gine jaate hain. Ab "STATES + UT". UP par "DISTRICTS".
    server.js me wo jagah bhi theek ki jahan label dhoondha jaata hai:
    "States + UT" me '+' regex ka khaas akshar hai, isliye ab escape
    hota hai -- warna ginti khaali reh jaati.

(2) HAR GHANTE WALA REFRESH AB JAGAH NAHI CHHUDATA   [phase 1]
    Pehle naya data aate hi page poora reload ho jaata tha: tab wapas
    Dashboard, filter saaf, sort default, scroll sabse upar. Agar aap
    Legislators me Bihar chhaan kar neeche the, sab gaya.

    Ab page band hone se pehle ek chhoti parchi (sessionStorage) me
    rakh liya jaata hai -- kaun sa tab, har filter/date/search ki value,
    Top Leaders ka sort, page ka aur table ke andar ka scroll. Reload ke
    baad loader hatte hi wahi wapas lag jaata hai. Beech me aapne khud
    kuch chhua to restore ruk jaata hai -- dakhal nahi deta.
    Manual F5 par bhi yahi faayda milta hai. Naya browser tab kholne par
    saaf page hi milta hai (ye jaan-boojh kar hai).

    NOTE: ye jhatka KAM karta hai, mitata nahi. Asli ilaaj -- per-tab API,
    jisme page reload hoga hi nahi -- phase 2 me alag se aayega.

(3) ELECTED REPRESENTATIVES ME SIRF ANDHRA PRADESH DIKHTA THA
    Data poora tha (saare legislators) -- dikkat sort ki thi. Table state
    ke NAAM se A->Z sorted thi aur ek page par 40 rows, isliye page 1
    hamesha Andhra Pradesh se bhar jaata tha.
    Ab default sort = Total Views (zyada se kam), to page 1 par poore
    desh ke sabse bade handle aate hain. State se dekhna ho to State
    filter maujood hai (UP par wo District filter hai).
    Upar jo "Showing 40 of 40 rows" wali patti aati thi wo jhooth bolti
    thi (sirf is PAGE ki rows ginti thi) -- is table se hata di. Pager
    pehle se sach bolta hai: "Showing 1-40 of 3,029 legislators".

(4) TOP LEADERS
    - Party ke baad ek aur filter: All India par State, UP par District.
      Party + Quick ke saath milkar chalta hai.
    - Default sort ab "Avg Views/Post" (pehle Total Views). Aapka apna
      chuna hua sort yaad rehta hai.
    - Reset ab location bhi saaf karta hai aur sort wapas default par.

(5) UP PAR "STATE" KI JAGAH "DISTRICT"
    UP dashboard me har handle ka state 'Uttar Pradesh' hi hota hai, to
    "State" column kuch batata hi nahi tha.
    Ab teen table (Top 50 Handles, Legislators Tracker, Top Handles-UP)
    me doosra column "District" hai aur usme asli jagah aati hai
    (Varanasi, Rae Bareli, Gorakhpur...). Teesra column "PC / AC Name"
    wahi cheez dobara dikhata tha, isliye CSS se chhupa diya -- wapas
    chahiye to UP ke template me "up-terms" wala <style> block hata
    dijiye.
    Parties tab ka filter bhi ab "District" hai ("All Districts").

    YE JAAN-BOOJHKAR WAISE KE WAISE HAIN (inme sach me state ki baat hai):
      India Map "CM Twitter Presence by State", "State CMs" panel aur
      uska dropdown, CM detail ka "State / UT", aur Handle-Request form
      ka "State" column -- wo Mapping.xlsx ke asli column ka naam hai.

JAANCH
    Poora suite: 3,190 jaanch, ek bhi fail nahi.
    Iske alawa asli Chromium me, asli data se banaya hua page chalakar:
      - item 5 : 36 jaanch (dono dashboard; dikhi hui value sach me usi
                 handle ka loc hai, ye data se mila kar dekha gaya)
      - item 2 : 13 jaanch (sach me reload karke -- tab, filter, rows,
                 table ka scroll, sort, aur "user chhue to ruk jao")
      - item 3 : 14 jaanch, item 4 : 17 jaanch
    Naye test suite me jud gaye: t_upterms.js, t_statekeep.js

