================================================================================
  13-OCT  --  Growth tab hata diya (dono dashboard)
================================================================================

  Sidebar se "Growth" wala button nikal diya gaya hai -- All India par bhi
  aur UP par bhi. Ab wo tab kahin se khulta nahi.

  Section ka markup (#sec-growth) aur uska JS jaan-boojh kar waise ka waisa
  chhoda hai -- us section ke andar ke kuch ids doosri jagah ka code bhi
  chhoota hai, poora markup kaat dene se kahin null aa sakta tha. Button na
  hone se wo kabhi dikhta nahi.

  Wapas chahiye? Template me "growth-off (13-Oct)" dhoondhiye -- neeche wala
  <div class="mnav-tab" data-tab="growth"> block comment me pada hai, usse
  comment hata dijiye. server.js ki tab-kram wali list me bhi 'growth' wapas
  jod dijiye (usi nishaan ke paas).

  Ek baat aur: agar kisi ka browser pichhli baar Growth tab par khula tha, to
  state-keep (12-Oct wali parchi) usme wapas le jaata. Ab wo sirf usi tab par
  jaata hai jiska button sach me maujood ho.

  JAANCH: poora suite 3,200 jaanch / 0 fail (t_nav.js me naya kram aur
  "Growth kahin se khulta nahi" wali jaanch jud gayi), aur asli Chromium me
  dono page chalakar 12 jaanch -- button nahi, baaki saare tab chalte hain,
  koi JS error nahi.
